{"id":"torrey:scribes","source":"torrey","name":"Scribes","slug":"scribes","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Antiquity of — Jdj 5:14.","refs":[["Judg",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Wore an inkhorn at their girdles — Eze 9:2,3.","refs":[["Ezek",9,2,9,2],["Ezek",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Kenites. — 1Ch 2:55.","refs":[["1Chr",2,55,2,55]]},{"text":"Zebulun. — Jdj 5:14.","refs":[["Judg",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Levi. — 1Ch 24:6; 2Ch 34:13.","refs":[["1Chr",24,6,24,6],["2Chr",34,13,34,13]]},{"text":"Generally men of great wisdom — 1Ch 27:32.","refs":[["1Chr",27,32,27,32]]},{"text":"Often learned in the law — Ezr 7:6.","refs":[["Ezra",7,6,7,6]]},{"text":"Were ready writers — Ps 45:1.","refs":[["Ps",45,1,45,1]]},{"text":"Secretaries to kings. — 2Sa 8:17; 20:25; 2Ki 12:10; Es 3:12.","refs":[["2Sam",8,17,8,17],["2Sam",20,25,20,25],["2Kgs",12,10,12,10],["Esth",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Secretaries to prophets. — Jer 36:5,26.","refs":[["Jer",36,5,36,5],["Jer",36,26,36,26]]},{"text":"Notaries in courts of justice. — Jer 32:11,12.","refs":[["Jer",32,11,32,11],["Jer",32,12,32,12]]},{"text":"Religious teachers. — Ne 8:2-6.","refs":[["Neh",8,2,8,6]]},{"text":"Writers of public documents. — 1Ch 24:6.","refs":[["1Chr",24,6,24,6]]},{"text":"Keepers of the muster-rolls of the host. — 2Ki 25:19; 2Ch 26:11; Jer 52:25.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,19,25,19],["2Chr",26,11,26,11],["Jer",52,25,52,25]]},{"text":"Were doctors of the law. — Mr 12:28; Mt 22:35.","refs":[["Mark",12,28,12,28],["Matt",22,35,22,35]]},{"text":"Wore long robes and loved pre-eminence. — Mr 12:38,39.","refs":[["Mark",12,38,12,38],["Mark",12,39,12,39]]},{"text":"Sat in Moses’ seat. — Mt 23:2.","refs":[["Matt",23,2,23,2]]},{"text":"Were frequently Pharisees. — Ac 23:9.","refs":[["Acts",23,9,23,9]]},{"text":"Esteemed wise and learned. — 1Co 1:20.","refs":[["1Cor",1,20,1,20]]},{"text":"Regarded as interpreters of Scripture. — Mt 2:4; 17:10; Mr 12:35.","refs":[["Matt",2,4,2,4],["Matt",17,10,17,10],["Mark",12,35,12,35]]},{"text":"Their manner of teaching contrasting with that of Christ. — Mt 7:29; Mr 1:22.","refs":[["Matt",7,29,7,29],["Mark",1,22,1,22]]},{"text":"Condemned by Christ for hypocrisy. — Mt 23:15.","refs":[["Matt",23,15,23,15]]},{"text":"Often offended at out Lord’s conduct and teaching. — Mt 21:15; Mr 2:6,7,16; 3:22.","refs":[["Matt",21,15,21,15],["Mark",2,6,2,6],["Mark",2,7,2,7],["Mark",2,16,2,16],["Mark",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"Tempted our Lord. — Joh 8:3.","refs":[["John",8,3,8,3]]},{"text":"Active in procuring our Lord’s death. — Mt 26:3; Lu 23:10.","refs":[["Matt",26,3,26,3],["Luke",23,10,23,10]]},{"text":"Persecuted the Christians. — Ac 4:5; 18:21; 6:12.","refs":[["Acts",4,5,4,5],["Acts",18,21,18,21],["Acts",6,12,6,12]]},{"text":"Illustrated of well instructed ministers of the gospel — Mt 13:52.","refs":[["Matt",13,52,13,52]]}],"refCount":48}
